Texti Gorani Privacy Policy

**Last updated: November 11, 2026**

Texti Gorani operates a Kurdish music and lyrics catalogue for listeners aged 18 and older. This policy covers the Android and iOS apps and the Texti Gorani website that opens inside them. If you have a question about your information or want help with a request, email [Textigorani@gmail.com](mailto:Textigorani@gmail.com).

## Your account and music library

When you register with an email address, we use your name, email address and password to create your account. We assign an account ID so that your profile and music library are available when you sign in again. The iPhone and iPad app uses Texti Gorani’s own sign-in form. On Android, you can also choose Google Sign-In. If you do, Google sends us a sign-in credential and account information, such as your name and email address. We do not receive your Google password.

We use your language preference, favorites, playlists and recently played songs to show your library and listening history. If you use discovery features or send feedback about a song, that activity can also be linked to your account. You can edit your profile and manage your favorites and playlists. A profile image is optional. If you provide a phone number for your account, we use it for account access or verification. If your profile includes a city or country, we may use it to manage your account.

## Cookies, analytics and embedded videos

The website uses cookies or similar storage in the app to keep you signed in and remember preferences. We use Google Analytics to understand which pages and features people use. When a page uses Analytics, Google can receive the page address, IP address, browser or device information, and usage events. Google may also read or set cookies.

Some music and videos play through an embedded YouTube player. When the player loads or you use it, YouTube can receive information about your device, network connection and playback. The player may show ads. Google explains how it uses this information, including when it may personalize ads, in [How Google uses information from sites and apps](https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites). You can manage Google ad preferences in [My Ad Center](https://myadcenter.google.com/). Where Texti Gorani offers cookie or analytics choices, you can change your preferences there.

## Who receives information and why

Our hosting provider processes information to run the service. Our email delivery provider processes email addresses and messages to deliver account, password recovery and deletion-verification emails. Google processes information for the sign-in, analytics and video features described above. If you contact support, we use your email address and the details you send to answer your request. We also use account and session information to protect accounts and prevent abuse. Texti Gorani does not sell personal information.

The apps connect to the Texti Gorani website over HTTPS, including when you sign in. Please do not send us passwords or verification codes by email.

## Deleting your account and what we keep

- **In the app:** Open **Profile → My Account → Delete Account** and follow the confirmation steps. You do not have to give a reason. Once confirmed, the in-account deletion is processed immediately.
- **Without the app:** Open the [account deletion page](https://textigorani.com/delete-account/?tg_lang=en), enter the email address for your account and follow the verification link we send. You can use this option after uninstalling the app.

Deletion removes your account, profile details, account-specific profile image, favorites, playlists, listening and discovery history, and any comments or feedback linked to your account. It also removes account verification and session data. Public music catalogue entries and aggregate analytics that are not linked to your account are not removed when you delete it.

To verify deletion and handle security or support requests, a limited deletion log may retain your former account name, email address and any city or country already on file for **up to 30 days**. We then remove those identifiers. De-identified statistics about the deletion reason and country may remain for **up to 12 months** before the log entry is removed. We do not obtain your precise location for this process.

## Questions and requests

To ask what account information we hold, request a correction, or get help with deletion, email [Textigorani@gmail.com](mailto:Textigorani@gmail.com). You can also reach app support at [zanest.av@gmail.com](mailto:zanest.av@gmail.com). When this policy changes, we will update the date at the top of this page.
